      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkïtï lö itu osiswö cho pö kömpölelyö ato le söröm.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lïku pich osiswechoni cho yongöy kegh opïn nko cho pïrchini ropïyen nko pich cho kwolöy kegh nko cho wulö kegh nko cho mwosïyi nko cho mötekönye yiyikwa nko cho meyokucha sörö nko cho mökonyïtöcha Tororöt, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nko cho melö chömöy piko walaka nko cho puryö kisyonöt nko cho swömöy pikö walaka nko cho le chepomutïn nko cho sïngiröch nko cho lilöy kïgh nyo karam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lïku pich wïchtoghï nko cho möyongöy kïgh nko cho kwolöy kegh nko cho chömöy ngörekyo ngwïny kïsir kïcham Tororöt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lïku pich cho, ato kiros ompö sany kïlentöy pich kighönï, wölo ompö oringwa töghöy owesyö nyo kïnyoruno kighanat. Ilowit kegh ompö pich cho lata choni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ompöwölo leptoy kegh pïchoni walaka kïlïtöy kori pich atolapay kulï mötöwöy akïpayta kor cho le sölwöy cho kösönöy nïkisïntino ngokï akï cho mi kïrïpöy pïrchinogh anka tïkwïl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mi koruchoni kïtenö osis kumukyini, kinetöy kegh, wölo memuköcha kïnyorï wölo mi man. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.7.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wuw 7:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mölöy pïchoni ngala man kïle wölanya kimölöy Yane nko Yampre Musa, akï pich cho kiwïryö mötöwö akupïtyeghö ara kighanat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo itöy onö? Ompöwölo sïwïyi lawel chi anka tïkwïl sölwontönengwa le nyaye kïsïwa pich sölwontöno Yane nko Yampre.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kirurut cho pö söröm",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo nyi Timoteo, olentan kinkïtunyi kinetutköchan nko otöptönyan nko kerötenyan ompö möngot nko kighanatenyan nko mïkukönötenyan nko chomnyenyan nko kamaghatenyan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.13.14+ACT.13.15+ACT.13.16+ACT.13.17+ACT.13.18+ACT.13.19+ACT.13.20+ACT.13.21+ACT.13.22+ACT.13.23+ACT.13.24+ACT.13.25+ACT.13.26+ACT.13.27+ACT.13.28+ACT.13.29+ACT.13.30+ACT.13.31+ACT.13.32+ACT.13.33+ACT.13.34+ACT.13.35+ACT.13.36+ACT.13.37+ACT.13.38+ACT.13.39+ACT.13.40+ACT.13.41+ACT.13.42+ACT.13.43+ACT.13.44+ACT.13.45+ACT.13.46+ACT.13.47+ACT.13.48+ACT.13.49+ACT.13.50+ACT.13.51+ACT.13.52"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ist 13:14-52",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
