              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.14.8+ACT.14.9+ACT.14.10+ACT.14.11+ACT.14.12+ACT.14.13+ACT.14.14+ACT.14.15+ACT.14.16+ACT.14.17+ACT.14.18+ACT.14.19+ACT.14.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "8-20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kinkïtunyi tïkwïl wölo kikichoptanïn kong owongwï, ainkïtönyi ngalechanye löwïr kipkonchanïn ompö okumpö Antiokia, Ikonio nko Lustra. Akï ngwonïn nyo tya nyaye kyakamaghan. Wölo kisörunenanïn Echotyon choni lapay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyoman Kichopöy kong chi anka tïkwïl nyo kamach kïmöngisyö kïkonyïtöy Tororöt, otini kikïlinyö nko Kristo* Yeso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tösöy tagh kïghochitu tya pich cho ghach cho le lïsï cho lïsöy pikö walaka akelïs kegh chane tïkwïl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo nyo le nyi, tasa tagh rïpa ngalechoni pö man kikinetinyi akeghananyi lasiny. Inkïtönyi nyinte lö ngo choni kinetïnyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkïtönyi tïkwïl lö kïngeta otini kichinyi monïng, kinkïtunyi Kikirut cho Tïlilöch cho muköy kwipunyi ngöghomnyö nyo ipu sörunöt ompö chi nyo ghönöy Kristo Yeso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tororöt nyinte nyini kintöghoghchï kekir Kikirut löwïr, akï cho mïchini keneta pich man akïripö kegh ghöyityö akuporchini pich cho kötosonchö ompö ara man. Netöy tïkwïl kïmöngisyö ompö or nyo pö tïlilïn, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "atökumï lasiny chi nyo pöghisyechini Tororöt, kwigh pöghisyö anka tïkwïl nyo karam.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
